			"notes": "This is a critical hotfix for an issue where setting `n_discs` to any value greater than 7 would prevent the player from creating a new world (#75). As far as I'm aware, this issue only affected the Minecraft 26.1 version of the mod.\n\nNote that players using more than 64 music discs (overriding the hidden `max_discs` setting in their config) will still have this issue\n\nThere are no changes to the resource pack generator, so feel free to continue using the version for the [v0.3.0 release](https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/FoxNap/releases/tag/v0.3.0).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/FoxNap/compare/v0.3.0...v0.3.1"
		},
