			"notes": "This release:\n- adds ModMenu integration (though note you'll still need to restart Minecraft after changing any settings)\n- adds tonewoods and end discs trades to The Maestro's trade pools if you have the [Lighter End](https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/LighterEnd) mod installed\n\nOn the resourcepack generator side,\n- The `FoxNapRPG` executable will now use your system's installation of ffmpeg if you have it installed\n- Meaning you can now install `FoxNapRPG` as a command-line utility via [pipx](https://github.com/pypa/pipx). See [the wiki](https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/FoxNap/wiki/Resource-Pack-Generator#installation) for details\n\nNote that the 1.21.5 build has been tested compatible with the Minecraft 1.21.6-8.\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/FoxNap/compare/v0.2.2...v0.2.3"
		},
