			"notes": "This release back-ports a bugfix to the versions of the mod for Minecraft 1.20.4 and 1.20.5/6.\n\n## What's Changed\n* FIX: Player was no longer visibly \"playing\" their instrument by @OpenBagTwo in https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/FoxNap/pull/68\n\nNote that no changes have been made to the Fox Nap Resource Pack Generator, but since v0.1.x generators are not compatible with v0.2.x versions of the mod (and vice versa), new compatible builds are provided below for convenience.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenBagTwo/FoxNap/compare/v0.1.2...v0.1.3"
